    "detailed_description": "Sucker Punch is a heart-pounding single and multiplayer experience! Battle your opponents using an arsenal of power-ups! Punch point cubes as they come at you to send them flying back at your opponent. Unleash power-ups to overwhelm your opposition and defend your goal!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLEASH YOUR POWERS - YOUR WAY</h2>Build your arsenal of gloves and drones each with their own powers. Mix and match your equipment to find your perfect playing style. Are you a heavy hitter who waits for the big strike, or do you prefer a fast and agile build?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE AND MULTIPLAYER</h2>Play a single match versus AI, or grab a friend and go head-to-head via multiplayer. Need a bigger challenge? Play a season and climb the league tables for trophies and ultimate glory!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced and fun! Easy to learn and a blast to master.<br></li><li> An arsenal of gloves, each with unique powers. Mix and match to find your play style and tactics.<br></li><li> Drones! Equip a buddy drone. They'll be your sidekick and help you to victory!<br></li><li> Gain XP. Level up. Unlock...and Power up!<br></li><li> Single-player: Choose your level and match yourself against AI opponents.<br></li><li> League play with progressively more difficult divisions and trophies to win.<br></li><li> Multiplayer: Go head-to-head with a friend.<br></li><li> Daily Challenges: A new and unique challenge each day. Can you get the highest score on the global leader board?.<br></li><li> An ever expanding library of new gloves, powers, and arenas!<br></li><li> LIV support!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN US</h2> <strong>Click the banner to join us on Discord and become part of our community!</strong><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Sucker Punch is a heart-pounding single and multiplayer experience! Battle your opponents using an arsenal of power-ups! Punch point cubes as they come at you to send them flying back at your opponent. Unleash power-ups to overwhelm your opposition and defend your goal!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/a1aad2c4efceb1b0af05690c3f5c2503.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLEASH YOUR POWERS - YOUR WAY</h2>Build your arsenal of gloves and drones each with their own powers. Mix and match your equipment to find your perfect playing style. Are you a heavy hitter who waits for the big strike, or do you prefer a fast and agile build?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/188f9b9e4f4e54440f93c65936cfb57f.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE AND MULTIPLAYER</h2>Play a single match versus AI, or grab a friend and go head-to-head via multiplayer. Need a bigger challenge? Play a season and climb the league tables for trophies and ultimate glory!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/2f956673844ae3bd601fd9cc7d177191.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced and fun! Easy to learn and a blast to master.<br></li><li> An arsenal of gloves, each with unique powers. Mix and match to find your play style and tactics.<br></li><li> Drones! Equip a buddy drone. They'll be your sidekick and help you to victory!<br></li><li> Gain XP. Level up. Unlock...and Power up!<br></li><li> Single-player: Choose your level and match yourself against AI opponents.<br></li><li> League play with progressively more difficult divisions and trophies to win.<br></li><li> Multiplayer: Go head-to-head with a friend.<br></li><li> Daily Challenges: A new and unique challenge each day. Can you get the highest score on the global leader board?.<br></li><li> An ever expanding library of new gloves, powers, and arenas!<br></li><li> LIV support!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.poster.avif?t=1640034756\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.webm?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491400/extras/d2da630c7ad6062a8e73bbe90e6f991b.mp4?t=1640034756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN US</h2> <strong>Click the banner to join us on Discord and become part of our community!</strong><br>",
    "short_description": "Like Pong, in VR, on Steroids, with Superpowers! Sucker Punch VR is a fast-paced arcade punch-fest! Go head-to-head wielding a variety of powers, to punch, parry, and strike your way to victory! Score cubes past your opponent while preventing cubes from getting past you. Easy.....right?",
